### W1: ForwardedProof defect (create; Task; priority Medium; labels `rec-2026-11-16`, `flaky-test`, `test`; marker `REC-LND-16NOV-W1`)
SUMMARY-W1: Test defect: ForwardedProofTests.The_web_front_end_value_is_gone_from_the_request_once_the_pipeline_has_read_it failed intermittently because the test read its watch value before the pipeline wrote it; fixed in pull request 325

BEGIN BODY-W1
BLUF: The test ForwardedProofTests.The_web_front_end_value_is_gone_from_the_request_once_the_pipeline_has_read_it (added by pull request 318) failed intermittently, on hosted CI and locally. It is a test defect, not a product race: the test read a plain field that its watch filter wrote only after the pipeline had run, and the test server returns the response before that. Pull request 325 (merged 2026-11-16 06:43 AEDT, main <<MAIN8>>) changes the test file only.
Recommendation: Nothing more to build. Watch the hosted api jobs on main; a red of only this test after pull request 325 means the fix is incomplete and this ticket gets a new round.
Detail: Sightings read from GitHub: the hosted api job on SQL Server (api-assessment) failed on main's own run for the squash of pull request 321 (run 43706040514) and for the squash of pull request 323 (run 43729467690), each with exactly this one test failed. The independent reviews measured it red in 2 of 5 and in 5 of 5 isolated runs at main, and the builder's alternating run read 4 of 6 red at main and at its head, equal rates. Cause: the filter ran `await nextMiddleware(context);` and only then wrote its reading; the test server completes the request once the response has started, so the test read nothing yet, `(False, null)`, or the previous request's reading, `(False, "198.51.100.7")`. The independent review read the proof check (ForwardedProofGate.cs), the forwarded-address record and Program.cs and found no product state written per request. Fix: the filter hands each reading over through a channel at the same place and the test awaits it, with a 30 second guard that can only fail the test (`ForwardedProofTests.cs:276-277`), plus a forcing test that holds the filter after the pipeline. One file changed, 40 lines added and 6 removed. Measured by the independent review: the target alone 11 of 20 red at main and 20 of 20 green at the head; the forcing test red in its red form 10 of 10 and green 10 of 10.
Done when: pull request 325 is merged to main and the hosted api jobs of main's run for that merge read success.
Records: entry C-<<CE3>> in the project's clarifications record.
Marker: [REC-LND-16NOV-W1]
END BODY-W1

